Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:06.44,akiba-sp,,0,0,0,,秋葉原
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:12.57,akiba-sp,,0,0,0,,破操者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:17.87,akiba-sp,,0,0,0,,謎之少女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.67,akiba-sp,,0,0,0,,謎之少年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:35.22,akiba-sp,,0,0,0,,脫衣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:23.33,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,{\frz7.791\fs55.5\3c&HDFA037&\4c&HF25464&\pos(707.7,366.6)}GONZO男子展覽會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:41.49,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZZhunYuan_GB18030\bord0\blur1\c&HE7E2DD&\3c&H604F36&\4c&H5F4D35&\fs49.5\\b0\frz355.8\frx356\fry352\pos(783.6,356.6)}影子先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:41.49,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,{\c&H131317&\3c&HF8F8FA&\4c&HF5F5F7&\fs-2\frz355.5\frx2\fry356\org(929,629)\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(872.8,608)}有保君想要的那個了哦
